    "inspection": "The indexed 2024–2025 programme regulations identify the Study Guide as Appendix E. The 2025–2026 faculty regulations distinguish faculty and programme rules. The 2025 faculty board minutes record abolition of the first-year propedeutic examination across Humanities in 2026–2027. That change does not establish equivalent first-year History coursework, two second-year History seminars, or a broad-route admission rule for Roman North Africa. The exact seminar permits GLTC explicitly. Direct retrieval of the current programme and faculty OER documents returned access blocks. The accessible archived 2025–2026 route has a different course list and splits the elective space, so it cannot supply the missing current modules."
